<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · site</p><h1 class="enc-title">Shinkolobwe</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Shinkolobwe is a uranium and radium mine in the Haut-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/katanga">Katanga</a> province of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/democratic-republic-of-the-congo">Democratic Republic of the Congo</a>, discovered in 1915 and worked by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/union-miniere-du-haut-katanga">Union Minière du Haut Katanga</a>. Its exceptionally rich ore supplied most of the uranium used by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manhattan-project">Manhattan Project</a>. The mine was officially closed after independence.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/shinkolobwe.jpg" alt="Shinkolobwe" width="320" height="245" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Chalux · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shinkolobwe.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
